{"$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/oasis-tcs/sarif-spec/master/Schemata/sarif-schema-2.1.0.json", "version": "2.1.0", "runs": [{"tool": {"driver": {"name": "Slither", "informationUri": "https://github.com/crytic/slither", "version": "0.11.6", "rules": [{"id": "1-1-divide-before-multiply", "name": "divide-before-multiply", "properties": {"precision": "high", "security-severity": "4.0"}, "shortDescription": {"text": "Divide before multiply"}, "help": {"text": "Consider ordering multiplication before division."}}, {"id": "2-1-missing-zero-check", "name": "missing-zero-check", "properties": {"precision": "high", "security-severity": "3.0"}, "shortDescription": {"text": "Missing zero address validation"}, "help": {"text": "Check that the address is not zero."}}, {"id": "3-0-solc-version", "name": "solc-version", "properties": {"precision": "very-high", "security-severity": "0.0"}, "shortDescription": {"text": "Incorrect versions of Solidity"}, "help": {"text": "\nDeploy with a recent version of Solidity (at least 0.8.0) with no known severe issues.\n\nUse a simple pragma version that allows any of these versions.\nConsider using the latest version of Solidity for testing."}}]}}, "results": [{"ruleId": "1-1-divide-before-multiply", "message": {"text": "Math.scale(uint256,uint256,uint256) (src/Math.sol#7) performs a multiplication on the result of a division:\n\t- a / b * c (src/Math.sol#7)\n", "markdown": "[Math.scale(uint256,uint256,uint256)](src/Math.sol#L7) performs a multiplication on the result of a division:\n\t- [a / b * c](src/Math.sol#L7)\n"}, "level": "warning", "locations": [{"physicalLocation": {"artifactLocation": {"uri": "src/Math.sol"}, "region": {"startLine": 7, "endLine": 7}}}], "partialFingerprints": {"id": "79b761971532bf5a3514445ba6e2119286f618da960eed3902b6f1bb2aad3af0"}}, {"ruleId": "2-1-missing-zero-check", "message": {"text": "Math.setOwner(address).o (src/Math.sol#6) lacks a zero-check on :\n\t\t- owner = o (src/Math.sol#6)\n", "markdown": "[Math.setOwner(address).o](src/Math.sol#L6) lacks a zero-check on :\n\t\t- [owner = o](src/Math.sol#L6)\n"}, "level": "warning", "locations": [{"physicalLocation": {"artifactLocation": {"uri": "src/Math.sol"}, "region": {"startLine": 6, "endLine": 6}}}], "partialFingerprints": {"id": "24ce98cb95f7bb603bc5e0ac6558f6739f800c40c3f04517668e2e1d0d118f01"}}, {"ruleId": "3-0-solc-version", "message": {"text": "Version constraint ^0.8.20 contains known severe issues (https://solidity.readthedocs.io/en/latest/bugs.html)\n\t- VerbatimInvalidDeduplication\n\t- FullInlinerNonExpressionSplitArgumentEvaluationOrder\n\t- MissingSideEffectsOnSelectorAccess.\nIt is used by:\n\t- ^0.8.20 (src/Counter.sol#2)\n\t- ^0.8.20 (src/Math.sol#2)\n", "markdown": "Version constraint ^0.8.20 contains known severe issues (https://solidity.readthedocs.io/en/latest/bugs.html)\n\t- VerbatimInvalidDeduplication\n\t- FullInlinerNonExpressionSplitArgumentEvaluationOrder\n\t- MissingSideEffectsOnSelectorAccess.\nIt is used by:\n\t- [^0.8.20](src/Counter.sol#L2)\n\t- [^0.8.20](src/Math.sol#L2)\n"}, "level": "warning", "locations": [{"physicalLocation": {"artifactLocation": {"uri": "src/Counter.sol"}, "region": {"startLine": 2, "endLine": 2}}}], "partialFingerprints": {"id": "d3d669cac53738435f2ccaa2ea8214170f68daf9a9f56a47243a2c7505b50de9"}}]}]}
